                                                "sense_id": "b9a3dd60-72af-3368-9cc8-265cee26721c",
                                                "text": "ALS is a progressive, neurodegenerative disease affecting the nerve cells in the brain and spinal cord that make the muscles of both the upper and lower body work, according to the ALS Association, a non-profit organization which works to research the disease and offer resources to people living with it."
                                            }
                                        ]
